   940→## State of the Art
   941→
   942→| Old Approach | Current Approach | When Changed | Impact |
   943→|--------------|------------------|--------------|--------|
   944→| Custom tooltip libraries (Tippy.js, Popper.js) | Native `<title>` elements on SVG | Phase 10 (2026) | Simpler codebase, better accessibility, no dependencies |
   945→| setInterval for animation | requestAnimationFrame | Phase 9 (2026) | Smooth 60fps, auto-pauses when tab hidden, syncs with browser repaints |
   946→| JSON.parse/stringify for cloning | structuredClone() | Phase 9 (2026) | 3-5x faster, handles TypedArrays and circular refs |
   947→| Object.freeze() for immutability | structuredClone() returns mutable objects | Phase 9 (2026) | Freeze only in dev mode (removed in production) |
   948→| All 256 memory rows rendered | Filter to non-zero addresses | Phase 11 (2026) | 90% fewer DOM nodes, faster rendering |
   949→
   950→**Deprecated/outdated:**
   951→- **Video.js for control UI:** Designed for media playback, not discrete state stepping - custom controls are simpler
   952→- **Manual button state tracking:** Phase 9 AnimationEngine methods (isAtStart, isAtEnd, isPlaying) eliminate manual tracking
   953→- **Stage-specific instruction fields:** Phase 10 decision to use state.pipeline.IF.instruction for all stages (non-pipelined) eliminates per-stage field duplication
